          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A humidifier air purifier combo is a space-saving answer to a small-room problem. In a bedroom, nursery or studio apartment, a well-built evaporative combo with real HEPA filtration and published ratings on both sides does both jobs well enough, with one footprint and one outlet.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
